; SniperTurtle_KZ_v1.00  -  WO60_ALN_none   (best of the v8 grid)
; ATTACH TO XAUUSD  M15
;
; ================= THE CONFIG =================
;   EMA 50/100/200, TRAIL OFF
;   Killzone window ON, 60-MINUTE LEAD  <- the single biggest factor in the
;     grid: lead 0 averaged -409 across its 60 sets, lead 60 averaged +1,119
;   ALL THREE killzones: Asia 1900-2400, London 0200-0500, NY 0700-1000 (NY clock)
;   QUALITY FILTER OFF. Not an oversight - across 128 combinations in v7 and 5
;     more in v8 the filters rank monotonically WORSE the more you add:
;       none +581   C +484   VC +266   TEBC +244   TEVBC +200
;   No server session filter. Risk 0.5%.
;
; ================= THE BACKTEST =================
;               net     trades   PF    maxDD
;     2025    +4,133      76    1.58    4.9%
;     2026    +5,463      49      -        -
;
; ================= WHAT YOU ARE ACCEPTING =================
; This is the BEST OF 120 SETS on two years - and both are years that every
; configuration upstream of this grid was already tuned on. It has never been
; tested on 2023 or 2024.
;
; That exact shape has already failed once in this project. V3_ema_50_100
; looked just as convincing on 2025+2026 (PF 1.29-1.43 on three timeframes),
; and when 2023 and 2024 were finally run it did not hold. Nothing here rules
; out the same outcome.
;
; turtle-grid/RUN_V9.bat runs this config and the next four on 2023 and 2024.
; It is about 40 passes. Running it does not delay anything you are doing - it
; just means that in an hour you will know something you do not know now.
;
; ================= GUARDS =================
; Prop guards are ON, set to FundedNext 25k figures (daily -600 of -750, total
; halt at -1200 of -1500, static drawdown, 3 losing trades a day). The
; backtest above ran WITHOUT them, so they cannot improve those numbers - they
; only cap the damage if live behaves differently from the test. Adjust
; InpBaselineBalance to your real account size.
;
; ================= BEFORE IT TRADES =================
;   * Fill InpTgToken / InpTgChatId on the machine. Never in the repo.
;   * VERIFY InpServerGmtOffset against your broker. It is 3.0 here and has
;     never been checked. All three killzone windows derive from it and it is
;     the only time gate in this config - wrong value means the EA trades the
;     wrong hours and nothing looks broken.
;   * ~50-76 trades a year on M15. Roughly one a week. Long quiet stretches
;     are the strategy working, not a fault.
